Maze Runner V5.4.2
  [--seed N] [--difficulty low|medium|high] [--verbose] [--quiet]
  --simulate ROWS COLS MONSTERS SEED [LIMIT_MS] [--difficulty low|medium|high] [--verbose] [--quiet]
Interactive play opens graphical setup; --difficulty preselects a card. No terminal input is required.
Simulation defaults to Medium. Low offers more routes and earlier relief; High increases pursuit pressure.
State logs are enabled by default; --verbose also logs every monster step.
Monsters wait until your first move or auto-solve. Only monsters within hearing range react.
Mouse/Tab/Enter: setup. WASD/arrows (hold to keep walking): move. G: auto-solve. Esc: pause. Q: quit. Wheel/+/-: zoom. Home: fit.
